  <FC_Designator_Topdress_Label>追肥</FC_Designator_Topdress_Label>
  <FC_Designator_Topdress_Desc>命令殖民者把堆肥施入土壤，恢复地力预算。需要田作堆肥（或垦壤堆肥）与「地力预算」研究。</FC_Designator_Topdress_Desc>
  <FC_NeedSoilBudgeting>需要研究：地力预算</FC_NeedSoilBudgeting>
  <FC_CannotTopdressTerrain>无法对 {0} 追肥</FC_CannotTopdressTerrain>
  <FC_NoCompost>没有可用的田作堆肥</FC_NoCompost>

  <FC_Designator_Fallow_Label>标记休耕</FC_Designator_Fallow_Label>
  <FC_Designator_Fallow_Desc>切换休耕标记。空闲休耕格会缓慢回充地力。最好先清掉作物。再点一次取消标记。需要「轮作休耕」研究。</FC_Designator_Fallow_Desc>
  <FC_NeedCropRotation>需要研究：轮作休耕</FC_NeedCropRotation>
  <FC_CannotFallowTerrain>无法对 {0} 休耕</FC_CannotFallowTerrain>

  <FC_Designator_Irrigate_Label>筑田/灌水</FC_Designator_Irrigate_Label>
  <FC_Designator_Irrigate_Desc>在土壤上：筑干水田。在干水田上：灌水成淹水田。水稻最宜淹水田。需要「水田工程」研究。</FC_Designator_Irrigate_Desc>
  <FC_Designator_Drain_Label>排水</FC_Designator_Drain_Label>
  <FC_Designator_Drain_Desc>把淹水田排回干水田。</FC_Designator_Drain_Desc>
  <FC_NeedPaddyWorks>需要研究：水田工程</FC_NeedPaddyWorks>
  <FC_CannotIrrigateTerrain>无法在 {0} 上筑水田</FC_CannotIrrigateTerrain>
  <FC_CannotIrrigateBuilding>建筑下方不能灌水</FC_CannotIrrigateBuilding>
  <FC_AlreadyFlooded>已经是淹水田</FC_AlreadyFlooded>
  <FC_NeedFloodedPaddy>需要淹水田</FC_NeedFloodedPaddy>

  <FC_Designator_PlowIn_Label>耕入还田</FC_Designator_PlowIn_Label>
  <FC_Designator_PlowIn_Desc>就地毁掉植物以回充地力（不产收获物）。绿肥三叶草最佳；干草草亦可。需要「绿肥」研究。</FC_Designator_PlowIn_Desc>
